<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Describe</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>describe &lt;part&gt;
describe general       what others see when they look at you
describe help          the list of parts
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>describe left eye
</pre>
<p>Writes the description others see when they look at you, or at a part of 
your body. The game shows what you have now, then opens a text box for the 
new text; when you finish, it replaces the old one. Colors work in 
descriptions (see <a cmd='#'>Help Colors</a>).
</p><p>The parts you can describe:
</p>
<pre>general     arms        back        butt        chest       ears
eyes        face        feet        hair        hands       head
legs        mouth       neck        nose        nostrils    teeth
left arm    left leg    left foot   left hand   left eye    left ear
right arm   right leg   right foot  right hand  right eye   right ear
</pre>
<p>Write in the spirit of the game, and in good taste.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Colors</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Look</a>
</pre>




</div>